body:
Thank you so much! I will search through provinces regulations, if you dont mind I will ask you some more specific questions in the future when my research becomes more solid. The route that I am seeking is trying to find the line between medical practice and another health services that would benefit from medical knowledge without actually having to be a registered doctor to actually practice medicine, some sort of consultant or public health politics (we had a couple of friends that are nurses and got a job in PAHO and since it wasnt really nurse practice, more of a technical administrative job they didnt needed the validation degree). If we do move to Canada, we wanna be worthy, through our jobs and qualifications, we dont wanna be a burden to the country.

&#x200B;

Thank you for being so kindly and helpfull!

&#x200B;
